Personal, user-scope Claude Code preferences -- not part of this repo.

Copy this file to `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` (created automatically the first
time you run `claude` if it doesn't exist) to apply these to every project
you work in, not just this one. Project scope (this repo's own `CLAUDE.md`)
and directory scope (a `CLAUDE.md` in a subfolder) both layer on top of this,
they don't replace it.

---

# Personal preferences

- Prefer terse commit messages: a single summary line unless the change
  genuinely needs a body.
- When unsure between two equally reasonable approaches, ask rather than
  picking one silently.
- I mostly work from a Windows machine with PowerShell as the primary shell;
  prefer PowerShell-safe command syntax when both are equivalent.
